   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HARD RULES\n1  No synthetic row contributes to any reported metric. Synthetic may train; only real may score.\n2  Every stage clock carries clock_source: three are statute, two are administrative targets.\n3  Open stages are right-censored (is_delayed = NULL), never scored as on-time.\n4  HIGH risk band is emitted only if holdout precision >= 0.70, else suppressed.",
   "originalText": "HARD RULES\n1  No synthetic row contributes to any reported metric. Synthetic may train; only real may score.\n2  Every stage clock carries clock_source: three are statute, two are administrative targets.\n3  Open stages are right-censored (is_delayed = NULL), never scored as on-time.\n4  HIGH risk band is emitted only if holdout precision >= 0.70, else suppressed.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
