   "text": "DEMO RELIABILITY TIERS\n1  live    frontend -> FastAPI -> SQLite\n2  cached  fallback middleware serves s7 / s15 JSON at the same URLs\n3  bundled flagship payloads compiled into api/client.ts (?demo=1)\nNo tier touches the network during a demo.",
   "originalText": "DEMO RELIABILITY TIERS\n1  live    frontend -> FastAPI -> SQLite\n2  cached  fallback middleware serves s7 / s15 JSON at the same URLs\n3  bundled flagship payloads compiled into api/client.ts (?demo=1)\nNo tier touches the network during a demo.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
